# Arabic mixed-script (fixed)

**Not a setting.** Applies to every Arabic/RTL reply, including the first reply of a new chat.

## Before send (blocking)

1. Draft the reply.
2. Check: every Arabic/RTL line starts with U+200F.
3. Check: every Latin term/path is wrapped U+2066 … U+2069 only (no bare Latin in Arabic lines).
4. Check: no fenced code box around mixed Arabic (including `problem-brief`).
5. Fail any check → fix marks → re-check. MUST NOT send until all pass.

